      "notes": "D = (0.06571441 × V²) + 15V, V = dutiable value ÷ 1,000, for values ≤ $525,000; then 4.95% (< $3M), 5.75% (≥ $3M, < $5M), 5.95% (≥ $5M) of the whole value. Boundary semantics per the Act. The additional $5 joint-tenant duty is NOT modelled and is listed in the route's limitations."
